{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SchurPrincipalBetaForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SchurPrincipalBetaForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RowLenAddCell","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBetaGapVandermonde"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.nPart_addCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.nPart_addCell","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L173-L184","doc":"**Adding a box at row `a` raises `n(λ)` by `a`.**  `n(λ) = ∑_c c₁`, and the new cell contributes\nits row index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.betaR_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.betaR_lt","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L165-L171","doc":"**The β-numbers strictly decrease.**  `β_i = μ_i + (r−1−i)`: the row lengths are weakly\ndecreasing and the shift `r−1−i` strictly decreases, so the sum strictly decreases. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.schurPrincipal_mul_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.schurPrincipal_mul_const","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L118-L144","doc":"**`schurPrincipal` in Vandermonde form, division-free.**\n\n`s_μ(1,Q,…,Q^{r−1}) · ∏_{i<r} descFactF (1−Qⁿ) (r−1−i) = Q^{n(μ)} · ∏_{i<j<r} (1 − Q^{β_i−β_j})`.\n\nThe left-hand constant does **not** depend on `μ` — it is the empty-partition contribution — so in a\nratio of two diagrams it cancels outright, leaving `Q^{n(ν)−n(μ)}` times a ratio of Vandermondes.\nThat is the branching ratio, and the remaining work is to identify `∏_{i<j}(1 − Q^{β_i−β_j})` with\n`vandPairProd r (fun i => Q^{β_i})` up to a monomial.\n\nThe only hypothesis beyond `μ` having at most `r` rows is that the hook product is nonzero — the\nsame genericity `schurPrincipal_eq_zero_iff` already carries, and exactly what makes the\n`schurPrincipal` quotient well-posed in the first place. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.contentProd_mul_descFactF_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.contentProd_mul_descFactF_eq","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L102-L114","doc":"**The two sides, equated.**\n\n`∏_c f(r − c₁ + c₂) · ∏_{i<r} descFactF f (r−1−i) = ∏_c f(h(c)) · ∏_{i<j<r} f(β_i − β_j)`.\n\nBoth equal `∏_{i<r} descFactF f β_i`, which therefore cancels: the numerator over the denominator is\nthe Vandermonde over a **`μ`-independent** constant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.contentSide_betaR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.contentSide_betaR","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L91-L100","doc":"**The content side, in `betaR` form.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.hookSide_betaR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.hookSide_betaR","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L68-L89","doc":"**The hook side, in `betaR` form.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.prodHooksF_paddedRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.prodHooksF_paddedRowLens","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L64-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.betaNum_paddedRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.betaNum_paddedRowLens","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L60-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sorted_paddedRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sorted_paddedRowLens","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L56-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.getD_paddedRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.getD_paddedRowLens","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L52-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.length_paddedRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.length_paddedRowLens","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L48-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.betaR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.betaR","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L45-L46","doc":"The β-number of row `i` **at `r` rows**: `μ_i + (r − 1 − i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.paddedRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.paddedRowLens","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SchurPrincipalBetaForm.lean#L41-L43","doc":"`μ.rowLens` extended with empty rows to length `r`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}